Fabric Loader code
------------------

ArgentumLoader is a fork of FabricMC/fabric-loader. Code that comes from Fabric
Loader is NOT covered by the notice above. It remains under the Apache License,
Version 2.0 (full text in LICENSE-APACHE-2.0.txt), copyright FabricMC and its
contributors. That licence and the upstream copyright notices cannot be removed,
and they also apply to the changes made to those upstream files. This means:

  * every file that carries the FabricMC Apache-2.0 header;
  * minecraft/, junit/ and the rest of the files that came from upstream:
    build.gradle, settings.gradle, gradle.properties, checkstyle.xml, HEADER,
    proguard.conf, gradlew, gradlew.bat, gradle/, .editorconfig,
    .github/workflows/release.yml, src/main/resources/ (except argentum/),
    src/test/resources/ and the upstream tests under src/test/java/.

Where a file listed under "All Rights Reserved" and a file from this section
disagree, the licence header written in the file itself decides.

Not covered
-----------

  * Bundled third-party libraries and fonts keep their own licences (ASM,
    SpongePowered Mixin, tiny-remapper, Gson, the PIXY font in argentum-client/,
    etc.).
